Anki Template Generator

Open index.html in a modern browser. Arrange your fields, select Front/Back,
and click Generate. Copy FRONT SIDE, BACK SIDE and STYLE into Anki's Cards editor.

The app works locally with no backend or build step. It starts with English on
both sides and Spanish on the back, saves settings locally, and supports JSON
configuration backups. Learning content stays in Anki.

See README.md for usage, source structure, tests and speech/platform limitations.
